# Evolution X for OnePlus 15 / 15T / 15R / Ace 6T

## Initialize local repository

```bash
repo init -u https://github.com/OnePlus-SM8850-Development/android.git -b bq2 --git-lfs
```

## Sync up

```bash
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

## Build

### Set up environment

```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
```

### Build the code

```bash
brunch <codename>
```

Or manually:

```bash
lunch lineage_<codename>-bp4a-userdebug
m evolution
```

## Submitting patches

Patches are always welcome! Please submit your patches via LineageOS Gerrit or open a pull request.

Simply follow our guide on [how to submit patches](https://wiki.lineageos.org/submitting-patch-howto.html).

To view the status of your and others' patches, visit [LineageOS Gerrit Code Review](https://review.lineageos.org/).
